{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は幕張メッセで個別握手会がありました〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変わらず来てくれる皆様、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始めましての皆様、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちびっ子達"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/30/7036816/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんとお話し出来て嬉しかったです〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビの私、ライブの私、握手会の私、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれにいろんな私が居るけど、どの私にも変わらず入るのは日々周りの皆さんへの感謝の気持ち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/30/7036816/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうを伝えられて嬉しいです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらくチームらにお花頂きました〜！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/30/7036816/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/30/7036816/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あやねちゃんは後の部だったから、全員集まれず(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもお花の色が、それぞれのキャラクターのカラーに分かれてて、久しぶりにみんなそれぞれのキャラクターのポーズになってみたよん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガンちゃん久しぶりっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/30/7036816/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のお洋服は、久々自分の趣味ドストライクのお洋服でした〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/30/7036816/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恐竜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足元にコンセントある笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"gommeのお洋服です〜スキー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/30/7036816/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時々、趣味の服着させてねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ね、めちゃ楽しい撮影の準備してるようヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}